# Desktop: Fast Alt+Tab off, Blank Screen saver, delay 7, spacing 80, Wrap Title off, blink rate three
# steps faster, granularity 2, border 5, OK (WIN.INI / SYSTEM.INI, the Control Panel's frame 5 px).
# Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/desktop-spin.scn; the spin arrows themselves: desktop-arrows.w16.
# Run: ARCH311_REF=<rig> ARCH311_REF_INI=1 tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-spin.w16 OUT Desktop
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 200
shot shots/02-fastoff.png
key tab
key down
sleep 200
shot shots/03-saver.png
key tab
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/04-delay.png
type 7
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/05-delay7.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
type 80
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/06-spacing.png
key tab
key space
key tab
key right
key right
key right
sleep 200
shot shots/07-blink.png
key tab
type 2
key tab
type 5
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/08-border.png
key enter
sleep 800
shot shots/09-ok.png
quit
